# Tests option annotations like {+x}, {-x}, {!x}, {?x}
# These use OptionArgument.return() which passes options to MaybeOption.
# A latent type error (this.args being undefined) was discovered and fixed
# during TypeScript annotation work - this test exercises that code path.

# Test {+x} - increment counter
+ {+count} [Add one. ]
# Test {-x} - decrement with threshold
+ {-count} [Remove one. ]
# Test {!x} - set to 1 (toggle on)
+ {!flag} [Set flag. ]
# Test {?x} - set to 0 (toggle off)
+ {?flag} [Clear flag. ]
>

Count is {(count)}, flag is {(flag)|off|on}.
->start

